            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova easya, Nĩkwĩthĩwa nĩmatiie mĩao yakwa ĩla naiie mbee woo, na matyaaĩw’a wasya wakwa, o na matyaoatĩĩa, ",
